{
    "title": "Plant Parent: Plant Care Guide",
    "description": "Want to become a better plant parent for your green babies?\r\n\r\nMeet Plant Parent \u2013 the app that offers solid plant care solutions. With Plant Parent, you can become an instant green thumb and keep your plants not just happy, but thriving!\r\n\r\nWhat you'll love about Plant Parent:\r\n\r\n-Smart Care Reminders\r\nNot sure when to water your plants or how to fertilize properly? Just add your plants to Plant Parent and get notified when it's time to water, fertilize, prune, propagate, repot, and more! \r\n\r\n-Plant identification\r\nHave had a plant for a while but not sure what it is? See a plant your like but the plant's name card is gone? No worries, just take a picture of it and Plant Parent will identify it for you right away! \r\n\r\n-Plant Calendar\r\nCreate a customized care calendar for your plant so that you can easily manage the watering and fertilizing schedules of your plants throughout the year! \r\n\r\n-Plant Illness 101\r\nAre your plants not feeling good? Get all your plant care questions answered! Plant Parent can help you figure out what's wrong and set up an effective treatment plan for your plants. Never kill a plant again!\r\n\r\n-Manage Your Plants\r\nWhere to put a plant? How much sunlight does it need? Yeah, it can be tricky sometimes. Plant Parent can sort it out and help you find the best places for  your plants!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Want to become a better plant parent for your green babies?<br><br>Meet Plant Parent \u2013 the app that offers solid plant care solutions. With Plant Parent, you can become an instant green thumb and keep your plants not just happy, but thriving!<br><br>What you&#39;ll love about Plant Parent:<br><br>-Smart Care Reminders<br>Not sure when to water your plants or how to fertilize properly? Just add your plants to Plant Parent and get notified when it&#39;s time to water, fertilize, prune, propagate, repot, and more! <br><br>-Plant identification<br>Have had a plant for a while but not sure what it is? See a plant your like but the plant&#39;s name card is gone? No worries, just take a picture of it and Plant Parent will identify it for you right away! <br><br>-Plant Calendar<br>Create a customized care calendar for your plant so that you can easily manage the watering and fertilizing schedules of your plants throughout the year! <br><br>-Plant Illness 101<br>Are your plants not feeling good? Get all your plant care questions answered! Plant Parent can help you figure out what&#39;s wrong and set up an effective treatment plan for your plants. Never kill a plant again!<br><br>-Manage Your Plants<br>Where to put a plant? How much sunlight does it need? Yeah, it can be tricky sometimes. Plant Parent can sort it out and help you find the best places for  your plants!",
